blems that they  have and following what you're really  passionate about so Jackie I hope that  helps i know it's some general advice  but do you have more specific questions  now feel free to leave a comment below  the video everybody else i'd love to  hear your comments too and also if you  want to give the video a thumbs up they  always appreciate those so thank you for  watching and stay tuned for next episode
 

